+// Fixed some synthesis warnings. Configured with caches and MMUs.
+//
+// Revision 1.7  2001/10/14 13:12:09  lampret
+// MP3 version.
+//
+// Revision 1.1.1.1  2001/10/06 10:18:35  igorm
+// no message
