+////  Description                                                 ////
+////  Interface between CPU and DC.                               ////
+////                                                              ////
+////  To Do:                                                      ////
+////   - make it smaller and faster                               ////
+////                                                              ////
+////  Author(s):                                                  ////
+////      - Damjan Lampret, lampret@opencores.org                 ////
+////                                                              ////
+//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
