@@ -0,0 +1,258 @@
+//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
+////                                                              ////
+////  OR1200's register file generic memory                       ////
+////                                                              ////
+////  This file is part of the OpenRISC 1200 project              ////
+////  http://www.opencores.org/cores/or1k/                        ////
