+////  Generic (flip-flop based) register file memory              ////
+////                                                              ////
+////  To Do:                                                      ////
+////   - nothing                                                  ////
+////                                                              ////
+////  Author(s):                                                  ////
+////      - Damjan Lampret, lampret@opencores.org                 ////
+////                                                              ////
+//////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
+////                                                              ////
+//// Copyright (C) 2000 Authors and OPENCORES.ORG                 ////
