+////  Memory Buffer Arbiter                                      ////
+////  Arbitrates between the internal DMA and external bus       ////
+////  interface for the internal buffer memory                   ////
+////                                                             ////
+////  Author: Rudolf Usselmann                                   ////
+////          rudi@asics.ws                                      ////
