+/////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////
+////                                                             ////
+////  WISHBONE Connection Matrix Priority Decoder                ////
+////                                                             ////
+////                                                             ////
+////  Author: Rudolf Usselmann                                   ////
+////          rudi@asics.ws                                      ////
+////                                                             ////
+////                                                             ////
+////  Downloaded from: http://www.opencores.org/cores/wb_conmax/ ////
